ows = prerequisites, dashed arrows = corequisites. The 'Engineering Practicums' (EN 1121 Prod Tech, EN 1141 Intro to CNC, EN 1151 Intro to PLCs) are marked 'Recommended but not required' and are not part of the sequenced hours.",
